omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E0ySP3aayQ0Q7kNvwG4jnuK&_nc_oc=AdrsgwM5vlS4-2nOEPCVWPjk8aQQCbUFfKiT_PTgW5CfrAj_8NxghiXXzxus3r842eg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQARU2dowdM0AN_EH7FAlWk3kBcRrlBuVqzIrek8clV35A&oe=6A525FB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9wE_kv3pjw8Q7kNvwFTdSLB&_nc_oc=Adp8tknO1HpwA6FBhcQPb_RDy1N8buEbbBJs5cPr3-4-0bNvef6p3GqclctQVnnJm0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB0bhggpS2Lt4mrQs3hNpkMS3kkNDWKlrIEK3zGcfz7kQ&oe=6A526116"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uzbMbivIRE4Q7kNvwEyhiVG&_nc_oc=Adq0czkGVAI3pH3K8DTa4n1JJCU0HV7P9clEv7NlR7OXDa0-Yf4YdduU2je-jJKLUhE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDEBt6htjIhkhpw3BlqRUHV1KVwxfnzEUkyiP_K9s3pJg&oe=6A523DF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://